Third-party notices

This package is a Swift port of the bcrypt password hashing implementation
and Blowfish block cipher from OpenBSD (lib/libc/crypt/bcrypt.c,
lib/libc/crypt/blowfish.c, include/blf.h). The original copyright and
permission notices are reproduced below, as their licenses require.

